          "summary": "The race clock reads hours and minutes all day",
          "details_markdown": "The countdown to midnight UTC used to switch to minutes and seconds in the last hour, so 58 minutes left read 58:45. It now reads hours and minutes all day (00:58 in the last hour, still in red) and never shows 00:00 while the race is open. Hover over it, or press and hold on a phone, to see the seconds too.",
